          "audio": "../../../art-masters/motion-comics/blue-purple/pages-01-04/audio-v3/takes/01-wendy-1f7aa77d1214.mp3",
          "duration": 6.4,
          "textFr": "Je m'appelle Wendy. On m'a envoyée si quelque chose tournait mal. Que s'est-il passé après HOLT ?",
          "textEn": "I'm Wendy. I was sent in case something went wrong. Tell me what happened after HOLT.",
          "ttsText": "[calm, reassuring] I'm Wendy. I was sent in case something went wrong. [curious, gently] Tell me what happened after HOLT?",
          "performance": "Calme adressé puis question vigilante ; aucune expiration ou soupir imposé.",
          "ttsModel": "eleven_v4",
          "takeJournal": "../../../art-masters/motion-comics/blue-purple/pages-01-04/audio-v3/takes/01-wendy-1f7aa77d1214.json"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-c02",
      "label": "Case 2 — La fuite",
      "rect": [
        0.004,
        0.357,
        0.448,
        0.304
      ],
      "holdSeconds": 4,
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "bp-l002",
          "globalLine": 2,
          "speaker": "john",
          "audio": "../../../art-masters/motion-comics/blue-purple/pages-01-04/audio-v3/takes/02-john-061e8f56e78a.mp3",
          "duration": 3.28,
          "textFr": "On a fui. Ils ne nous ont pas lâchés.",
          "textEn": "We ran. They kept coming.",
          "ttsText": "[shaken, exhausted] We ran. [bitter, barely contained] They kept coming.",
          "performance": "Épuisement et souvenir de fuite, rudesse amère ; aucune expiration imposée.",
          "ttsModel": "eleven_v4",
          "takeJournal": "../../../art-masters/motion-comics/blue-purple/pages-01-04/audio-v3/takes/02-john-061e8f56e78a.json"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
